        "bhavartha": "In its last verse the hymn speaks about itself. Whoever recites this holy hymn of the five syllables near Śiva reaches Śiva's world and rejoices together with Śiva. Śiva's name comes three times: near Śiva, in Śiva's world, with Śiva."
      },
